      "group_id": "hphase_1ece137dae255a95f6444e61",
      "id": "hp_4dfa4e01e79d18e5e60d7725",
      "ordinal": 12,
      "paragraph_id": "hp_4dfa4e01e79d18e5e60d7725",
      "phase_id": "hphase_1ece137dae255a95f6444e61",
      "segments": [
        {
          "conclusion_ids": [
            "hcon_d55a12fdc0044a816621230c"
          ],
          "event_id": null,
          "event_relation": null,
          "source_conclusion_ids": [
            "r3-c003-part-2"
          ],
          "text": "周瑜年轻时便精通音乐。即使喝了三杯酒以后，乐曲中只要有一点差错，周瑜也一定能听出来；听出来后，他必定回头去看演奏者。因此当时人们编了歌谣说：“曲子弹错了，周郎就回头。”"
        }
      ],
      "source": {
        "fragment_version": "r3-real-publication-01a0aa45-b717-7b29-bbae-afd7b72f7fcf-part-2",
